Key Difference: Indicative vs. Final


Feature	        Indicative PPMP	                Final (Approved) PPMP
Status	        Tentative / Forecast	        Authorized / Actionable
Bidding	        Cannot start bidding	        Can start bidding
APP Status	    Listed as "Indicative" or       Listed as "Firm" in the APP
                    "Provisional"	
Budget	        Estimated / Pending	            Allocated / Confirmed
Changes	        Highly flexible	                Requires formal amendment